Package: claude-tray
Version: @VERSION@
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: awkto <awkto@outlook.com>
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 45), gir1.2-soup-3.0
Homepage: https://github.com/awkto/claude-tray
Description: Claude usage monitor for GNOME Shell
 A GNOME Shell top-bar extension that displays Claude account usage limits,
 reset times, and threshold notifications.
